<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 23.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 23.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.09    2.16</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.89    1.94</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	10.00    0.98</p>
